     // Brain Engine 0043 (LLAMA_MOE_STANDIN): for a one-word batch of layer il, where the graph copies the router scores
     // (F32 [n_expert, 1], what the gating reads; sigmoid: the gating is a sigmoid, else a softmax), nullptr if there are
